org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1wgn7eb"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4z"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden=""><div data-rid="99b2fa3d-b9cc-467d-8623-2ddf635d2c70" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-oyyn34"><div data-rid="c0e954bd-9bdc-4c1c-9de9-181e3de84b9e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-19a50i6 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>A Seatopia membership is like a Community Supported Seafood box, bridging the gap between you and sustainable aquafarms. This model allows our farmers to plan their harvests more effectively, promoting a focus on quality and ecosystem health. In line with the Slow Food Movement, we're stepping away from impersonal, commodity-based supply chains. Subscriptions are flexible—you get preferred pricing, and can adjust or cancel anytime. This isn't just about buying seafood; it's a pact for a sustainable, transparent food system.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0b309e67-1219-43cc-96a1-7f6b5f81bd4e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-zg4o59" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="15ab405c-0e5a-4ae5-9ad3-ce63acf8154c" aria-expanded="false" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-rhoq4a"><div data-rid="5a05324e-2630-4af0-a312-8aff225e1b32" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-my5h8h alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Why choose farmed instead of wild-caught?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="e043f424-4b55-44fd-8c2b-c6c785402a6e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-8d2rwv"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-znwwiz"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4z"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden=""><div data-rid="e02bec41-e218-4443-9eb4-f8f7818b67f7" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-17iufad"><div data-rid="c885dd23-e522-40c6-a181-6e51ca74fa80" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-10s70cu alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Cleaner Profile</strong><br>Thanks to our stringent farming practices, specific species selection, and certified clean feed, our farm-raised seafood contains lower levels of mercury, PCBs, and microplastics compared to many wild-caught alternatives.</p></span></div><div data-rid="2280aaeb-aaa7-4531-8c2b-131a0bb6ce12" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1wfcdac alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Nutrient-Rich</strong><br>Our seafood is higher in essential nutrients and omega-3 fatty acids. This is because we control the diets of our fish to optimize their health benefits, ensuring they are fed a balanced diet rich in the nutrients that matter most.</p></span></div><div data-rid="bc23dbfc-6393-4d6f-8504-d03350fa8e7c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-egn34 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Natural Coloring</strong><br>Just like wild-caught fish, the vibrant colors of our farm-raised seafood come from a diet high in antioxidant-rich micro-algae, specifically astaxanthin. This means you're getting a product that's not only beautiful but also natural.</p></span></div><div da